diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index c948b06..df57127 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,4 +2,23 @@
 
 Runs lint, tests, and a scheduled CodeQL analysis.
 
-Actions are referenced by major version tag. There is no Dependabot configuration.
+## Action updates
+
+Every action in `.github/workflows/` is pinned to a full 40-character commit SHA, with the release
+it points to in a trailing comment (for example `# v7.0.1`). Tags are mutable, so a tag reference
+can change without any edit to this repository.
+
+Dependabot keeps the pins current (`.github/dependabot.yml`):
+
+- It checks the `github-actions` ecosystem weekly.
+- All action updates are grouped into a single pull request.
+- A 7-day cooldown delays adoption of a brand-new release, so a malicious release has time to be
+  noticed and yanked before it is proposed here.
+- Dependabot rewrites both the SHA and the version comment.
+
+Do not edit action versions by hand or switch a reference back to a tag. Review the grouped pull
+request by reading the upstream diff between the old and new SHAs, not just the version number, then
+merge it. Leaving it open leaves the actions frozen at old versions.
+
+Pinned versions at the time Dependabot was added: `actions/checkout` v7.0.1, `astral-sh/setup-uv`
+v10.3.0, and `github/codeql-action` v4.39.0 (v4.39.1 was inside the cooldown).
